  "description": "The Rove AL is an affordable aluminum gravel bike built for everyday rides and whatever happens once the pavement runs out. Its geometry mirrors Kona’s higher-end gravel bikes, delivering a comfortable, confident ride whether you’re commuting to work, heading to class, running errands, or exploring dirt roads on the weekend. It’s approachable, versatile, and ready to turn “just a quick ride” into something much harder to explain. The Rove AL keeps the price grounded while your plans get increasingly out of hand.",
